{"reviews":[{"id":"B07Q3TV77S-0","r":5.0,"t":"Buy these lashes","x":"Super lightweight but fluffy lashes. They are super long and easily able to be trimmed if need be. I love dramatic lashes so these were perfect for me. They have multiple layers too so they don\u2019t give you that \u201cfan\u201d look. Someone asked me if they were individuals they looked so fabulous. Will buy again!","h":6,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B07Q3TV77S-1","r":5.0,"t":"Dramatic Mink Lashes Good Quality","x":"I love theses lashes and for the price you really can not go wrong. The only thing would be for the company to come out with more styles. Less dramatic, natural and dramatic.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B07Q3TV77S-2","r":5.0,"t":"Best Lashes ever.","x":"[[VIDEOID:725d4f025fadbbd2cbc6dfdc07c474b9]] Obsessed with these lashes ever since i put them on ! They're Bomb.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B07Q3TV77S-3","r":5.0,"t":"The only Lashes I buy!!","x":"Extremely comfortable and the only Lashes I get it perfect for glam or every day natural face","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B07Q3TV77S-4","r":5.0,"t":"Stand Out!","x":"These lashes are beautiful. I received tons of compliments while wearing them. I like how each set gives you a completely different look. If you take care of them, you can get multiple wears out of them. I've had them for two months and I just started to notice minimal shedding after 10 wears, so the value for the price that I paid was beyond expectations. I definitely plan on ordering again without hesitation.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07Q3TV77S-5","r":5.0,"t":"I LOVE THESE !","x":"I purchase all the time I love these lashes , I like to use them on clients since I am a makeup enthusiast/ artist . The girls love these for prom or special celebrations where they want to be a little \u201cextra\u201d and these still look feminine and elegant even though they\u2019re super long they don\u2019t look dragging. The band is thick and the mink hairs are quality for the price . Thanks ! I hope the company keeps the same quality I don\u2019t want to see these go down in quality .","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07Q3TV77S-6","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful and Fluffy","x":"Omggg they so pretty and fluffy look just like the picture! I cannot wait to wear these I\u2019m not ordering eyelashes nowhere else but here I\u2019m a forever customer for sure","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B07Q3TV77S-7","r":5.0,"t":"I love this!!!!!","x":"I love these lashes beautiful length and volume and it makes my other lashes look crappy. I love how it curls up. I will definitely be ordering more.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B07Q3TV77S-8","r":4.0,"t":"Just like the picture.","x":"I love these lashes, they are so long and full just like the picture. Very soft and super easy to apply! Will be purchasing again.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B07Q3TV77S-9","r":5.0,"t":"Worth it","x":"Beautiful lashes looks just like the photo shipping was fantastic I ordered it Saturday night received it Sunday afternoon","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B07Q3TV77S-10","r":5.0,"t":"AliExpress who?!","x":"Mad complements from my followers , people love these lashes I love them too, will buy again!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B07Q3TV77S-11","r":5.0,"t":"Great price","x":"Love how pretty they look,how light weight they feel and I love the price.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B07Q3TV77S-12","r":5.0,"t":"Must buy!","x":"Love the lashes, too dramatic, but amazing feeling!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B07Q3TV77S-13","r":5.0,"t":"They are HUGE FYI & Beautiful","x":"Love Huge lashes These are great quality","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B07Q3TV77S-14","r":1.0,"t":"HARD TO APPLY, DO NOT WASTE YOUR MONEY!","x":"I am a lashes connoseur. I usually buy really expensive lashes, Yalorde Lashes being my favorite. YOU GUYS SHOULD GOOGLE THEM THEY'RE AMAZING.  However, I am deployed right now and Amazon makes sure items get sent correctly to your APO. So i went out on a limb and ordered these lashes because I love the dramatic look. However the band on these eye lashes do not stay down. I have been wearing lashes everyday for years now and I can apply them very easy and quick. No matter what eyelash glue I use","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07Q3TV77S-15","r":4.0,"t":"Good but not best!","x":"These lashes are good but not the best I\u2019ve ever worn. My issue is with the massive amount of curl back on the lash, which is only a preference and not the manufacturer\u2019s fault. My other issue is they definitely have that glare back that most acrylic lashes have even though they are advertised as mink. It could be the pairs I received but it definitely doesn\u2019t stop me from wearing them though! For the price, they are pretty good.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B07Q3TV77S-16","r":5.0,"t":"I love them!","x":"These lashes look exactly as pictured. Super soft and the hair looks and feels very natural unlike the plastic looking lashes from the beauty supply. They make your face pop, I received so many compliments on them. Cute packaging as well. Will be purchasing again in the future.  IG: @RangeRoverrr","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B07Q3TV77S-17","r":5.0,"t":"U need it","x":"I bough these because I was tired of buying over expensive pairs from Sephora.  The shipping was really fast, and when I got them they came with a cute little note from the seller. They have lasted me thus far (2 months) and I wear them often. WORTH THE MONEY AND SO CUTE BITCH BUY THESE.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07Q3TV77S-18","r":5.0,"t":"Long Lashes that Don't Look Crazy!!!","x":"I really am obsessed with lashes and usually buy from instagram brands but those 20mm lashes get expensive.  ACROWN lashes are affordable, long, and super cute. I got so many compliments and they are dramatic but not overpowering like some of the other asian brands. 100% recommend","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07Q3TV77S-19","r":5.0,"t":"Wore them for prom great lashes","x":"In ordered these lashes about a week before prom and they came in about 2 days. They were super soft and dramatic. Wouldn\u2019t suggest them for an everyday or natural look because they are far from that however I would buy again","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07Q3TV77S-20","r":5.0,"t":"Wore them for prom great lashes","x":"In ordered these lashes about a week before prom and they came in about 2 days. They were super soft and dramatic. Wouldn\u2019t suggest them for an everyday or natural look because they are far from that however I would buy again","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07Q3TV77S-21","r":1.0,"t":"these are not it !","x":"they are so wispy and frizzy .. they just look nappy and old .. like i hate them .. and i love long 25mm lashes i love that dramatic look but this is NOT it lady\u2019s TRUST ME ! they look messy and CHEAP AF","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07Q3TV77S-22","r":2.0,"t":"Massive","x":"Like the amount of long and big you think they are, quadruple it, these lashes reached past my eyebrows I would have been mad I spent $14 on them if I wasn\u2019t dying at how ridiculous they made me look.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07Q3TV77S-23","r":5.0,"t":"LASHES ARE AMAZING \u203c\ufe0f","x":"[[VIDEOID:33038c5c545797be75c943bc4858a904]] These lashes are very pretty! I love dramatic and long lashes. They are the bomb for the price. I am going to buy over and over again. It\u2019s worth it","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07Q3TV77S-24","r":4.0,"t":"Best lashes","x":"[[VIDEOID:49f2e88424e2e44fda11dff7ab7f85b8]] Loved it. Don\u2019t usually wear mink strips, I wear mink individuals. They come in handy. And I can sleep in them and they stay in place.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the lashes for being beautiful, fluffy, and looking just like the product photos.","cites":[7,8,9,10,12]},{"text":"Many customers highlight the dramatic, long, and full volume these lashes provide.","cites":[1,2,6,8,13,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers mention receiving compliments while wearing them and plan to repurchase.","cites":[5,6,11,12]},{"text":"Customers commonly describe the lashes as lightweight and comfortable to wear.","cites":[1,4,12,13]},{"text":"A few reviewers note the lashes are easy to apply and can be reused for multiple wears with proper care.","cites":[5,9]}]},"qa":[]}